        ("Coastal brown ants", "Hamersley's brick paving, driveways and retaining walls on free-draining sand host linked super-colonies that run under fences from one cul-de-sac to the next. Slow-acting non-repellent products and baits, APVMA-registered, applied to label. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant treatment</a>."),
