    now="Spring in Hamersley is coastal brown ants on the paving first, then redbacks and black house spiders back on brickwork and under outdoor furniture, and wasps scouting eaves near the reserves. Hamersley's roof framing is among the oldest we service, so a termite inspection now, ahead of the November alate flights, is the job to book before the general spray.",
