        ("Termites", "Forty-year-old timber roof framing on the Dampier Avenue side and limestone pockets under the whole suburb. Inspections to AS 4349.3 and non-repellent chemical systems to AS 3660.2, drilled and injected where the limestone is shallow. <a href=\"/termite-inspection-perth\">Termite inspection</a>."),
        ("Coastal brown ants", "Warm sand over limestone is the habitat coastal brown ants were named for, and Kallaroo's paved driveways and pool surrounds sit right on it. We treat the colony with a slow-acting non-repellent product and bait, APVMA-registered and applied to its label. <a href=\"/ant-control-perth\">Ant management</a>."),
        ("Rats in the roof", "Roof rats off the Whitfords Nodes dunes and the foreshore reserve, in through corroded eave mesh and unsealed roof penetrations. Baiting to label plus a proofing list for each entry point we find. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
        ("Spiders and cockroaches", "Redbacks under limestone coping and outdoor furniture, black house spiders on rendered walls, and American cockroaches from stormwater and sewer lines on the lower Northshore streets. Low-odour, non-staining products indoors. <a href=\"/general-pest-control-perth\">General pest treatment</a>."),
