    now="September in Kallaroo: coastal brown ants are trailing along paving edges as the sand warms, redbacks are back under garden furniture along the Northshore streets, and the roof rats that moved in over winter are still there. The 1970s homes east of Dampier Avenue are the ones to book a termite inspection for now, before the November swarm flights show you what established last summer.",
