        ("Do pests come out of the dune reserve into Ocean Reef homes?", "That reserve is the reason Ocean Reef has more rat, spider and native cockroach activity than suburbs a kilometre inland. Rats move off the dunes into ceilings in autumn, black house spiders and cockroaches come onto the walls year-round. We treat the external perimeter to label and give you a proofing list for the roofline. <a href=\"/rodent-control-perth\">Rodent management</a>."),
